WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.109
Today we will revise a work thoughtfully. Our work connects with Ghanaian and other

00:00:05.109 --> 00:00:05.811
African artists.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:09.753
Read or listen to one helpful comment on the draft.

00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:15.225
Choose one change that supports the artwork’s purpose. Record why your chosen

00:00:15.225 --> 00:00:16.761
technique suits the message.

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:20.838
Make the change and explain how the second version improved.
